accination coverage were not conducted.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All analyses were conducted using SAS (version 9.4; SAS Institute).\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}